---
// Home page while no guide is live: says what the site is and how to reach us.
interface Props { market: any }
const { market } = Astro.props;
const where = market.id === 'GB' ? 'the UK' : 'the US';
---
<section class="wrap holding" aria-labelledby="holding-title">
  <p class="kicker">Coming soon for {where}</p>
  <h1 id="holding-title">Fix it, upgrade it, <em>or keep it.</em></h1>
  <p class="holding-lede">Straight answers about the espresso machine, grinder and milk on your counter: what to fix, what to upgrade, and when yours is fine.</p>
  <ul class="holding-list">
    <li>Why your latte tastes flat, and the cheapest fix</li>
    <li>Which upgrade actually changes the cup</li>
    <li>When to keep what you have</li>
  </ul>
  <p class="holding-note">The first guides are being written now. Questions about your setup? <a href="mailto:hello@yourcoffeesetup.com">hello@yourcoffeesetup.com</a></p>
</section>
